---
import { sitePath } from '../../lib/site';
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import { projects } from '../../data/projects';
const maintained = projects.filter(project => project.repo && project.kind !== 'library');
const platforms = [
  { device: 'Desktop', platform: 'KDE Plasma', icon: 'monitor', detail: 'Linux with KDE Plasma is the desktop focus. The rest of the system stack is still to be decided.' },
  { device: 'Phone', platform: 'Android', icon: 'phone', detail: 'Android is the mobile focus. Mobile Linux is a longer-term interest, rather than a current target.' },
  { device: 'Watch', platform: 'PebbleOS', icon: 'watch', detail: 'Pebble is the watch platform, starting with apps and a watchface for Pebble Time 2.' },
];
const stages = [
  { number: '01', id: 'phase-one', title: 'Start with replaceable apps', status: 'Starting here', text: 'Begin with smaller apps where a failed experiment has limited consequences and another tool can take over. Rapid, AI-assisted development can help make this first stage achievable. The current Pebble downloads are development builds.' },
  { number: '02', id: 'phase-two', title: 'Build dependable everyday software', status: 'Later', text: 'Develop stable editions for daily use, alongside separate experimental editions for trying different interfaces and workflows. An experimental edition would explore an alternative idea; it would not simply be the unfinished next release.' },
  { number: '03', id: 'phase-three', title: 'Work deeper in the systems', status: 'Longer term', text: 'Move beyond individual apps into our own Android and PebbleOS variants and deeper Linux or KDE work. Whether the desktop needs a distribution, a KDE fork or another approach is still to be decided.' },
];
---
<BaseLayout title="About XOCE" description="XOCE’s goal: an open-source ecosystem across KDE Plasma, Android and PebbleOS, starting with everyday apps and growing with contributors.">
  <main id="main" class="wrap about-page">
    <header class="about-intro">
      <p class="eyebrow">Xef’s Open Computing Ecosystem</p>
      <h1>About XOCE</h1>
      <p class="about-lead">Useful apps. Shared tasks.<br/>Room to try another way.</p>
      <p class="about-intro-detail">XOCE is Xef’s project to build an open-source ecosystem for KDE Plasma, Android and PebbleOS. It starts with small apps and a bigger question: how could everyday software work better, on its own and across devices?</p>
    </header>

    <section id="platforms" class="platform-scope" aria-labelledby="platforms-title">
      <h2 id="platforms-title" class="scope-heading">The platforms the project is built around</h2>
      <div class="platform-row">{platforms.map(item => <article>
        <div class="platform-label"><Icon name={item.icon} size={23}/><span>{item.device}</span></div>
        <h3>{item.platform}</h3>
        <p>{item.detail}</p>
      </article>)}</div>
    </section>

    <section id="everyday-software" class="about-section two-column" aria-labelledby="everyday-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Why start small?</p><h2 id="everyday-title">Make something useful.<br/>Learn from using it.</h2></div>
      <div class="reading-copy"><p>A timer is a manageable place to try an idea. If it does not work for you, another app can take its place. That makes small, replaceable tools a useful first step towards a much larger project.</p><p>The wider focus is everyday software: messaging, calls, file management, notes, terminals and more. The exact apps and priorities will develop with the project. Making a task understandable matters as much as adding features; a different interface is worth exploring when it could make that task easier.</p><p id="phone-plan">Phone is planned as a standalone Android app, with an optional Pebble companion. <a href={sitePath('/projects/phone/')}>Read the Phone plan.</a></p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/projects/')}>See the current software <Icon name="arrow" size={17}/></a></div>
    </section>

    <section id="connected-devices" class="connection-goal" aria-labelledby="connections-title">
      <div class="connection-heading"><p class="eyebrow">What makes it an ecosystem?</p><h2 id="connections-title">Pick up the same task<br/>on another device.</h2></div>
      <div class="reading-copy"><p>A timer should be the same countdown wherever you look at it. Starting it on a phone, checking it on a watch and pausing it from a computer would share both its state and its controls.</p><p>That connection is a future goal. Today’s Pebble apps can share a timer summary with compatible watch apps and the watchface. Sharing it with the phone and desktop still lies ahead.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section id="stages" class="about-section stages" aria-labelledby="stages-title">
      <header id="direction" class="section-intro"><p class="eyebrow">How the project could grow</p><h2 id="stages-title">A direction,<br/>one step at a time.</h2><p>These are flexible stages, without dates. Work can overlap, with cross-device connections developing along the way. Xef is starting the first stage; later work will need more contributors.</p></header>
      <ol class="stage-list">{stages.map(stage => <li id={stage.id}>
        <span class="stage-number" aria-hidden="true">{stage.number}</span>
        <div><p class="stage-status">{stage.status}</p><h3>{stage.title}</h3><p>{stage.text}</p></div>
      </li>)}</ol>
      <div id="personal-data" class="later-goal"><h3>Personal data and JMAP</h3><p>Later work should also include JMAP-based calendars, tasks, contacts and related tools. The exact apps, server choices and timing have not been decided.</p></div>
    </section>

    <section id="contribute" class="about-section two-column contribution" aria-labelledby="contribute-title">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Take part</p><h2 id="contribute-title">Start with something<br/>you want to improve.</h2><p class="contribution-context">Try a build, work on an interface, fix a guide or contribute code. The current app repositories are the place to report problems and propose changes.</p></div>
      <div class="reading-copy">
        <p>Found a problem? Include the app version, your watch and phone, what you did, and what you expected to happen.</p>
        <nav class="issue-links" aria-label="Report a problem with an app">{maintained.map(project => <a href={sitePath(`${project.repo}/issues`)}><span>{project.name}</span><span>Issues <Icon name="external" size={14}/></span></a>)}</nav>
        <p>For code or documentation changes, use the <a href={sitePath('/docs/develop/building/')}>build and contribution instructions</a>. To make an activity provider, start with the <a href={sitePath('/docs/develop/activities/')}>Activities guide</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="source-and-licences" class="source-note" aria-labelledby="source-title">
      <h2 id="source-title">Source and licences</h2><p>The open-source ecosystem is the project’s aim. Current Pebble releases make their source available under <strong>PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0</strong>. Check each project’s terms before reusing its source or assets.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/docs/project/licensing/')}>Licences and asset credits <Icon name="arrow" size={16}/></a>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .about-page { padding-top: clamp(32px,4.5vw,54px); }
  .about-intro { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr); gap:0 70px; align-items:end; padding-bottom:clamp(30px,4.5vw,50px); }
  .about-intro > .eyebrow { grid-column:1 / -1; }
  .about-intro h1 { grid-column:1 / -1; margin-top:17px; font-size:clamp(2.5rem,4.2vw,3.7rem); font-weight:600; line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:-.05em; }
  .about-lead { max-width:28ch; margin-top:25px; font-size:clamp(1.45rem,2.5vw,2rem); line-height:1.4; letter-spacing:-.025em; }
  .about-intro-detail { max-width:52ch; margin-top:25px; font-size:1rem; line-height:1.8; color:var(--muted); }
  .platform-scope { border-block: 1px solid var(--line); padding-block: 26px 32px; }
  .scope-heading { font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.5; font-weight: 550; color: var(--muted); }
  .platform-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr)); gap: 38px; margin-top: 27px; }
  .platform-label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 11px; color: var(--accent-text); font-size: .875rem; }
  .platform-row h3 { font-size: 1.35rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.3; letter-spacing: -.025em; margin-top: 13px; }
  .platform-row p { max-width: 35ch; margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .about-section { padding-block: clamp(35px,4.5vw,54px); }
  .two-column { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: clamp(34px,7vw,92px); }
  .about-section h2, .connection-goal h2 { margin-top: 15px; font-size: clamp(1.95rem,3.2vw,2.8rem); font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.13; letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  .reading-copy { font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .reading-copy p { color: var(--muted); }
  .reading-copy p + p { margin-top: 19px; }
  .reading-copy a:not(.text-link) { text-underline-offset: .2em; }
  .reading-copy .text-link { margin-top: 20px; color: var(--accent-text); }
  .connection-goal { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; gap: clamp(34px,7vw,92px); padding: clamp(28px,4.4vw,52px); background: var(--glass-feature-surface); border: 1px solid var(--glass-edge); border-radius: var(--radius-pane); box-shadow: var(--glass-shadow); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px); backdrop-filter: blur(24px); }
  .connection-heading { min-width: 0; }
  .connection-goal .reading-copy { font-size: 1rem; }
  .stages { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; column-gap: clamp(34px,7vw,92px); align-items: start; }
  .section-intro { position: sticky; top: 110px; }
  .section-intro > p:last-child { margin-top: 22px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 37ch; }
  .stage-list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
  .stage-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 36px 1fr; gap: 20px; padding-block: 29px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .stage-list li:first-child { padding-top: 0; border-top: 0; }
  .stage-number { color: var(--accent-text); font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.6; padding-top: 2px; }
  .stage-status { color: var(--accent-text); font-size: .8125rem; font-weight: 550; line-height: 1.6; }
  .stage-list h3 { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.35; letter-spacing: -.025em; }
  .stage-list h3 + p { margin-top: 14px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .later-goal { grid-column: 2; padding: 24px 0 0 56px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .later-goal h3 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5; }
  .later-goal p { margin-top: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .contribution { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .contribution-context { margin-top: 22px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9375rem; line-height: 1.8; max-width: 36ch; }
  .issue-links { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr)); column-gap: 26px; margin-block: 23px; }
  .issue-links a { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; min-height: 48px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: .9375rem; text-decoration: none; }
  .issue-links a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .issue-links a > span:last-child { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 5px; font-size: .75rem; color: var(--muted); }
  .source-note { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .85fr 1.15fr; column-gap: clamp(34px,7vw,92px); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 26px; }
  .source-note h2 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 550; line-height: 1.6; }
  .source-note p { font-size: .875rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--muted); }
  .source-note .text-link { grid-column: 2; margin-top: 13px; color: var(--accent-text); font-size: .875rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .about-intro { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:0; }
    .about-intro h1 { font-size:clamp(2.5rem,8vw,3.5rem); }
    .about-intro-detail { margin-top:18px; }
    .platform-row { gap: 24px; }
    .two-column, .connection-goal, .stages, .source-note { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 25px; }
    .section-intro { position: static; }
    .section-intro > p:last-child, .contribution-context { max-width: 62ch; }
    .later-goal, .source-note .text-link { grid-column: 1; }
    .reading-copy { font-size: 1rem; }
    .connection-goal h2 br { display: none; }
    .source-note { gap: 12px; }
    .source-note .text-link { margin-top: 0; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .platform-row { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); gap: 22px; }
    .platform-row article { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 92px 1fr; gap: 8px 16px; }
    .platform-label { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 1 / 3; align-items: start; padding-top: 3px; gap: 8px; }
    .platform-row h3 { margin-top: 0; font-size: 1.1875rem; }
    .platform-row p { grid-column: 2; margin-top: 0; }
    .connection-goal { padding: 26px 23px; }
    .stage-list li { grid-template-columns: 28px 1fr; gap: 15px; }
    .later-goal { padding-left: 43px; }
    .issue-links { column-gap: 20px; }
    .issue-links a { gap: 8px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 360px) { .issue-links { grid-template-columns: minmax(0,1fr); } }
</style>
